    H2('16.2 Counting Bloom filter')
    P('Parameters k (hash count) and m (counters) chosen for expected unique txs per session. On see(hash): if probably present, reject; else insert and admit. Support reset per session for demos. Never use CBF as the security decision — only admission.')
    H2('16.3 Disassembly notes')
    P('Handle PUSH1–PUSH32 immediates. Treat INVALID and unknown opcodes conservatively. For creation transactions, prefer runtime code when separable; document choice. Node features for GCN v1: block length, opcode histogram coarse bins, has_call, has_delegatecall, has_sstore, has_selfdestruct, ends_with_jump.')
