    H1('20. Paper deep-dives for builders')
    P('This section restates each bibliography item as an implementation constraint. Read it when you are about to cut scope or copy a method blindly.')
    H2('20.1 Haq et al. — Carbyne')
    P("Problem they solve: mempool memory blow-up under spam. Method: store fingerprints in counting Bloom filters rather than full transaction indexes. Result highlights: memory drop with high forwarding fidelity on Bitcoin traces. Gap: not a security detector; Ethereum CarbEth not measured. Build rule: CBF is admission only. Never report CBF reject as 'malicious'.")
    H2('20.2 Durieux et al. — SmartBugs')
    P('Problem: tools evaluated on private, incompatible sets. Method: shared harness + curated and wild corpora. Finding: tools miss many known bugs and over-flag wild contracts. Build rule: report detection on sb-curated style labels; do not treat tool agreement as ground truth.')
    H2('20.3 Ghaleb & Pattabiraman — SolidiFI')
    P('Problem: false negatives hard to quantify. Method: inject 9369 bugs into 50 contracts; stress six analysers. Finding: large miss rates even for supported types. Build rule: use injected labels as gold for recall; also use those contracts as augmentation seeds.')
    H2('20.4 Dai et al. — ORACAL')
    P('Problem: single-view graphs and opaque decisions. Method: CFG+DFG+CG with RAG/LLM and causal attention. Gap for us: DFG/CG need Solidity; not timed for mempool. Build rule: keep multimodal fusion idea; do not pull Slither AST into the hot path for v1.')
    H2('20.5 Daian et al. — Flash Boys 2.0')
    P('Problem: DEX bots and MEV reorder pending trades. Method: measurement and modelling. Build rule: justifies watching the pending stage; does not supply our detector.')
    H2('20.6 Qin et al. — flash loans')
    P('Problem: atomic flash-loan attacks with huge ROI. Method: case study + optimisation. Finding: malicious vs benign flash use is hard. Build rule: semantic/intent branch required; DeFi-Intent-Bench exists for a thin slice of this problem.')
    H2('20.7 Zhuang et al. — DR-GCN / TMP')
    P('Problem: rule tools miss complex bugs. Method: contract graphs + GCN/TMP. Accuracies reported in the 70–80s on three bug types. Gap: source graphs. Build rule: GCN yes, but build graphs from bytecode CFG.')
    H2('20.8 Liu et al. — CGE')
    P('Problem: pure GNN misses expert patterns. Method: fuse expert features into embeddings. Build rule: fusion precedent; our second modality is LoRA Qwen, not hand patterns only.')
    H2('20.9 Sun et al. — GPTScan')
    P('Problem: GPT alone floods false positives. Method: scenario match + static confirm. Runtime: multi-second per kLoC. Build rule: never send whole projects to the LLM on the hot path; always keep a non-LLM second signal (GCN).')
    H2('20.10 Liu et al. — PropertyGPT')
    P('Problem: writing formal properties is slow. Method: RAG + GPT-4 + prover. Build rule: borrow retrieval habit for offline assist if useful; not a mempool module.')
    H2('20.11 Liu et al. — FinDet')
    P('Problem: adversarial contracts ship as bytecode. Method: semantic lift + multi-round LLM with uncertainty. Build rule: lift opcodes to short text; consider agreement across samples as confidence; still add GCN + CBF for our claim.')
    H2('20.12 Sheng et al. — OBFPROBE')
    P('Problem: obfuscated transfers break detectors. Method: taxonomy + Z-score ranking. Finding: SourceP accuracy collapse under deep obfuscation. Build rule: build verified transform pairs; measure our fused detector across severity levels.')
    H2('20.13 Wu et al. — DeFiRanger')
    P('Problem: price manipulation missed by classic bug scanners. Method: cash-flow semantic lifting on raw txs. Build rule: motivates intent-style questions; historical crawler is not our hot path.')
    H2('20.14 Luo et al. — SCVHunter')
    P('Problem: weak graphs / weak expert use. Method: heterogeneous attention on IR graphs. Strong offline accuracies. Build rule: attention/heterogeneous ideas optional for GCN v2; v1 stays simple GCN on bytecode CFG.')
    H2('20.15–17 Forta docs')
    P('Industry pre-inclusion firewall with AI score and vendor latency claims. Build rule: cite as existence proof of the product category; never paste vendor % into our results chapter; our metrics come from SmartBugs/SolidiFI/testnet only.')
